      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهدّج</span></b>  <i>It</i> (the voice, or a sound) <i>became
much intercepted,</i> or <i>interrupted,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقَطَّعَ</span>) <i>with a
tremulous manner.</i> (S, K.) See 1. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهدّجوا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَيْهِ</span> <i>They made apparent,</i> or <i>manifest, his gracious
actions,</i> or <i>qualities,</i> or <i>his favours,</i> or <i>kindnesses.</i>
(TA.)

